भृ—कुटि or भृ—कुटी, f. = भ्रू-कुटि (also ˚ति-कुतिलानन, ˚टि-बन्ध, ˚टी-मुख), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
 ˚टि-धर, mfn. contracting the brows, Mcar.;
 (ई), f. a species of frog, Suśr.
 (with Jainas) N. of a goddess, L.;
 (इ), m. (with Jainas) N. of the servant of the 20th Arhat of the present Avasarpiṇī, L.

